---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Experience from "../components/Experience.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Research Labs — K2Labs"
  description="Active research labs at K2Labs focused on AI systems and medical intelligence for real-world community challenges."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold">Research Labs</h1>
  </section>

  <!-- Narrated lab stage with click-to-hear cards and quick checks -->
  <section class="mt-8">
    <Experience slug="labs" locale="en" />
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 mt-20">
    <p class="text-lg text-brand-off/80">
      K2Labs operates focused research labs that address real-world challenges
      identified directly from communities. Our work is grounded in practical
      constraints, ethical responsibility, and accessibility.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-brand-off/80">
      All labs are currently in the <strong>prototype</strong> stage and evolve
      through continuous collaboration with students, volunteers, and domain
      experts.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- AI Systems Lab -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 mt-20">
    <div class="border border-brand-navy/60 rounded-lg p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">AI Systems Lab</h2>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-brand-off/80">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-medium text-brand-off">Problem</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Communities in Tier-3 environments often lack access to usable
            intelligent systems that can operate under real-world constraints
            such as limited infrastructure, time pressure, and resource scarcity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-medium text-brand-off">Approach</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We collaborate with Tier-3 students and volunteers, guided by
            experienced experts, to research and prototype AI systems that are
            simple, interpretable, and aligned with community needs.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Our focus is on applying technology where it meaningfully reduces
            effort, improves decision support, and respects human judgment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-medium text-brand-off">Current State</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Prototype
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-medium text-brand-off">Ethics Considerations</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We design systems to make life easier by leveraging technology
            responsibly, ensuring accessibility, affordability, transparency,
            and long-term sustainability.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Medical Intelligence Lab -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 mt-20 mb-24">
    <div class="border border-brand-navy/60 rounded-lg p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Medical Intelligence Lab</h2>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-brand-off/80">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-medium text-brand-off">Problem</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Patients and doctors in Tier-3 regions face challenges such as
            high patient load, limited diagnostic support, and lack of
            accessible decision-assistance tools tailored to their context.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-medium text-brand-off">Approach</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We work closely with healthcare communities, students, volunteers,
            and medical experts to research assistive intelligence that supports
            clinical workflows without replacing human judgment.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Technology is applied cautiously, with strong emphasis on usability,
            safety, and context-awareness.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-medium text-brand-off">Current State</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Prototype
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-medium text-brand-off">Ethics Considerations</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We prioritize patient privacy, informed consent, human-in-the-loop
            decision making, and the development of solutions that are affordable
            and sustainable for real-world healthcare environments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
